[38;2;124;124;124mrational curves through $3d-1$ points — these count rational curves (images), [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mbut even here multiple covers contribute for $d > 1$ in certain contexts, and [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mthe count is of stable maps not just morphisms.[0m

